# Installation

Get the project onto your machine. Replace these steps with your own — the structure is what matters.

## Prerequisites

You'll need the `work` CLI on your `PATH`. Everything below assumes you're inside this folder.

## Install

```
work new docs my-docs      # scaffold a fresh copy of this template
cd my-docs
work dev .                 # watch + re-weave as you edit
```

That's it — open the printed URL and you're reading your own docs. The next page, [Quickstart](/getting-started/quickstart), walks through making your first change.
